const contacts = $input.first().json.contacts || [];
const targetFirst = $('Receive Delete Contact Request').first().json.body.firstName.toLowerCase().trim();
const targetLast = $('Receive Delete Contact Request').first().json.body.lastName.toLowerCase().trim();

const match = contacts.find(c =>
  (c.firstName || '').toLowerCase().trim() === targetFirst &&
  (c.lastName || '').toLowerCase().trim() === targetLast
);

if (match) {
  return [{ json: { found: true, contactId: match.id, name: `${match.firstName} ${match.lastName}` } }];
} else {
  return [{ json: { found: false, contactId: null } }];
}

const body = $('Telnyx Call Status Webhook').item.json.body;

let conversationInsightsWrapper = [];
try {
  conversationInsightsWrapper = JSON.parse(body.ConversationInsights || '[]');
} catch (e) {
  conversationInsightsWrapper = [];
}

const insightsEntry = conversationInsightsWrapper[0] || {};
const conversationInsights = insightsEntry.conversation_insights || [];
const status = insightsEntry.status;

const CALL_ANALYSIS_INSIGHT_ID = 'YOUR_TELNYX_INSIGHT_ID';
const analysisInsight = conversationInsights.find(i => i.insight_id === CALL_ANALYSIS_INSIGHT_ID);

let parsed;
if (status !== 'completed' || !analysisInsight) {
  parsed = {
    call_outcome: 'no_meaningful_conversation',
    call_summary: `Could not retrieve call insights (status: ${status || 'unknown'}).`,
    user_sentiment: 'unknown',
    call_successful: 'no',
    callback_time_requested: 'none',
    disqualification_reason: 'n/a',
    transcript_text: '',
    parse_error: true
  };
} else {
  try {
    parsed = JSON.parse(analysisInsight.result);
  } catch (e) {
    parsed = {
      call_outcome: 'no_meaningful_conversation',
      call_summary: analysisInsight.result || 'Could not parse insight result',
      user_sentiment: 'unknown',
      call_successful: 'no',
      callback_time_requested: 'none',
      disqualification_reason: 'n/a',
      transcript_text: '',
      parse_error: true
    };
  }
}

let recordingUrl = null;
let callDurationSecs = null;
try {
  const recordings = JSON.parse(body.Recordings || '[]');
  const mono = recordings.find(r => r.channels === 'dual') || recordings[0];
  if (mono) {
    recordingUrl = mono.download_urls?.mp3 || null;
    if (mono.start_time && mono.end_time) {
      const startMs = new Date(mono.start_time).getTime();
      const endMs = new Date(mono.end_time).getTime();
      callDurationSecs = Math.round((endMs - startMs) / 1000);
    }
  }
} catch (e) {
  recordingUrl = null;
  callDurationSecs = null;
}

return [{
  json: {
    ...parsed,
    recording_url: recordingUrl,
    call_duration_secs: callDurationSecs
  }
}];

